                                "sense_id": "f756dd9e-4d71-3054-892e-a1e9998eeb81",
                                "text": "Mrs Dibble was in her morning state of sobriety, which is to say that, having had a few gins, her deboshed innards were temporarily stultified, and gave her the illusion of functioning correctly when they were merely in a state of torpor."
